extends /base.pug
block body
  include list.pug
  #landing
    #landing-demo #[div] #[div]
    .gradient
    #hero-text
      h1.title MAKEBACKGROUND.IO
      h2.desc Impress Your Customers with Live, Customized Backgrounds / Wallpapers / Videos.
    #quick-picker
      br
      for item in ["burning", "under-sea", "glowing-fall", "flying-elves", "network"]
        .thumb(style="background-image:url(/backgrounds/" + item + "/index.jpg)",data-name=item)

      .text-center
        div: small .. more ..
        img(src="/assets/img/icon/down.svg",style="margin-top: -10px")
  #gallery
    +nbr(3)
    .text-center: big Pick your favor background to customize it..
    +nbr(2)

    .list
      each name in ["waves", "burning", "autumn-leaves", "under-cloud", "glowing-fall", "mystery", "flying-elves", "polygon", "paper-contour", "spotlight-gradient", "above-clouds", "cloudy-sky", "gradient-wave", "snow", "network", "under-sea", "trianglify", "ternary-gradient", "contour", "smooth-contour"]
        a.item(href="/bk/" + name + "/")
          .thumb(style="background-image:url(/backgrounds/" + name + "/index.jpg)")
          .name= name
    +nbr(4)
    .text-center
      div Need more? Help us by sharing it!
      +nbr(2)
      .row.w-50.mx-auto
        .col-sm
          a.btn.btn-block.btn-outline-primary.mr-2.mb-2(href="https://www.facebook.com/sharer/sharer.php?u=https://makebackground.io",target="_blank") share with facebook #[i.fa.fa-facebook]
        .col-sm
          a.btn.btn-block.btn-outline-primary(href="https://twitter.com/share?url=https://makebackground.io&text=super-fast%20live%20background%20generator%20for%20modern%20age",target="_blank") share with twitter #[i.fa.fa-twitter]

  #info: .inner
    .text-center
      span.green about this service
      h2 Live Background Generator You've Never Seen Before
    .sep.huge-gap
    p Have you ever see live backgrounds in some amazing websites or landing pages? Live backgrounds can impress your customers, and bring your design to the next level. But it's not always easy to make, even if you have sophisticated softwares like Adobe After Effect or Blender.

    p #[span.green Makebackground.io] provides 20 carefully crafted animated backgrounds in both #[span.green PNG] and #[span.green Webm] format for supporting both #[span.green static wallpaper] and #[span.green motion graphics] to fully power your projects with stunning, aesthetic backgrounds, with guideline in mind when we built it:
    ul
      li Make It Quick and Beautiful
      li On the Web, on the Fly
      li Easily Customizable for Your Own Style
      li Optimized, with WebGL

    p To further power up websites with optimized payload size, we also plan to release source codes for all these images with friendly API for web developers. Just Stay tune!

    +nbr(2)
    h2 Technical Consideration
    .sep
    p To optimize rendering we use WebGL, a widely adopted technology in nowaday browsers. However, some old browsers don't support WebGL such as older version (<=10) of Microsoft Internet Explorer. Performance may also vary across browsers due to their different implementation or their running environment.

    p For now we only support Webm video generation with Google Chrome browser, but you can still convert webm to mp4 using other tools. We will support more formats (like #[span.green MP4] or #[span.green GIF]) and browsers for video generation.
    br
    h4 Browser Compatibility
    p Webm video format is currently supported by browsers including Google Chrome, Mozilla Firefox, Opera and (partially) Microsoft Edge. Unfortunately Safari doesn't support it.

    br
    h2 License
    .sep
    p tl;dr - #[span.green free for both personal and commercial use].
    p We expect makebackground.io to grow and become sustainable by itself, while it's for now a "proof of concept" and not even a MVP. Thus, all generated images / videos are free for both personal or commercial use. This is subject to change in the future, but you #[span.green keep the right] if you download them before we change the rule.
    p Additionally, we also plan to open the source code used to generate all these backgrounds; it will, then, be dual license - free for personal use, charge for commercial use. We will make it more clearer once we are ready for it.
    //-p You can check the #[a(href="/license/") license page] for more detail about licensing.

    +nbr(2) 

    h2 Resources
    .sep
    p WebGL and Shader language is quite complicated comparing to plain JavaScript, but you may still want to learn more about them. We curated a #[a(href="#") awesome-webgl] list for you to learn more about it, including libraries, tutorials, and people that are also working on creative art.
    p Animation is always an interesting topic for people who want to make interactive content. We also provide online icon animation with #[a(href="https://loading.io") loading.io]. It also provides open sourced solution including #[a(href="https://loading.io/animation/") loading css] and #[a(href="https://loading.io/transition") transition.css].

    p We expect to integrate #[a(href="https://maketext.io") maketext.io] for a more sophisticated animation builder, before that you may want to take a look of it.

    +nbr(2)
    h2 Contact
    .sep
    p We want to build this service to its best, but there are always bugs or glitches. Feel free to contact us via #[b contact@makebackground.io] by mail, or leave your words in the disqus widget below. We always appreciate your feedback and support, by which we could make this service better together.
    br
    #subscribe.card
      .card-body
        h3 Get on the list
        .sep
        p we are constantly building better tools for the web, often with open-sourced libraries for anyone to use. Our portfolio includes animation service "#[a(href="https://loading.io",target="_blank") loading.io]", text styling service "#[a(href="https://maketext.io/") maketext.io]", and data visualization service "#[a(href="https://plotdb.com") plotdb.com]". Want to get noticed when we release our next service? Just subscribe our newsletter! :)
        input#email.form-control.form-control-lg.mb-2(type="text",
        placeholder="Sign up to be the first to hear about the next launch")
        .btn.btn-block.btn-action.btn-lg(onclick="subscribe()") Get on the list
    +nbr(3)
    .text-center any background you need but we don't have? welcome to suggest below!

  #disqus_thread
  script.
    var disqus_config = function () {
    this.page.url = "https://makebackground.io/";
    this.page.identifier = "/";
    };
  include /module/disqus.pug

  include module/footer.pug
  script(src="/js/index.js")
